      "value": "Those are already whitelisted actually, using myself with AimIK. The problem is that, as per linked documentation \"All rotation limits work with IK solvers that support rotation limits.\" And the VRIK/FBIK solvers (that are pieced from Limb and Leg IK etc) do not support those.",
