      "value": "@{5b2e71ca041f043e0f606944|full_name}: Dj is right, I have used multiple FIK scripts and a majority of the ones I've tested do indeed work. You need to use the IK Execution Order script to make sure your FIK scripts run after the normal VRIK, otherwise they will not work correctly when used on VRIK-affected bones. I cannot speak for Root Motion specifically, but I would try the execution order script in conjunction with it if you haven't already.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
