  "details": "There is a rotation constraint but it doesn't work the way that I think would be really useful. root motion has pretty much the exact component in it that I would want so if those got whitelisted it would really increase what could be done. here is the page on them for root motion\n\nhttp://www.root-motion.com/finalikdox/html/page14.html\n\nexamples of use cases:\n\narmor shoulder pad that stops going down with the arm after a certain point but will raise with the arm when the arm moved above a point\n\nany part of an outfit that would raise but not lower more then resting, shawls, most things around shoulder and neck\n\nwould be really useful for wider skirts or dresses so your legs can move freely under the skirt/dress without acting like they are glued to your legs even if the legs are nowhere near them, but still raise with the leg once the leg reaches past the rotation limiters limit",
